  "system": {
    "description": "<p>The target gains an extraordinary ability to heal their wounds. Examples of this include the supernatural regeneration of a troll, a super soldier's adrenal biomod, or the ability to channel energy that results in continous healing. Regardless of the source, wounds close before the very eyes of an onlooker.</p>",
    "effect": "While the regeneration boon is sustained, the target heals hit points at the beginning of each of the <em>boon invoker's</em> turns. The amount of healing is determined by the power level of the boon.\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Power Level 1</strong> - 1d4 </li>\n<li><strong>Power Level 3</strong> - 1d6 </li>\n<li><strong>Power Level 5</strong> - 1d8 </li>\n<li><strong>Power Level 7</strong> - 1d10 </li>\n<li><strong>Power Level 9</strong> - 2d6 </li>\n</ul>",
